
% Crash My Party

a: IV | I | vi | V |
link: IV | I | vi | V |
In: $a*2
instr: $a*2
PostCh: $a*2
b: VI | IV | I | V |
Vr: $b*2
c: IV | V | vi | viio |
c_turnaround: IV | I | ii |
PCh: $c $c_turnaround
Ch: $a*4
PCh_2: IV | I | vi | V |
ending: IV |
S: [G] $In $Vr*2 $PCh $Ch $link $Vr $PCh $Ch $instr $PCh_2 $Ch $PostCh $ending
